@startuml FinancialManagement_ApprovalSeq

title Sequence Diagram - Financial Approval (Pengurus: Ketua/Wakil/Bendahara)

actor Pengurus
participant "Dashboard" as Dashboard
participant System
database Database

Pengurus -> Dashboard: Buka dashboard keuangan
Dashboard -> Database: Query pending transactions
Database --> Dashboard: Return pending list
Dashboard --> Pengurus: Tampilkan pending transactions

Pengurus -> Dashboard: Filter by status = pending
Dashboard -> Database: Query pending only
Database --> Dashboard: Return pending transactions
Dashboard --> Pengurus: Tampilkan filtered list

Pengurus -> Dashboard: Klik pending transaction
Dashboard -> Database: Query transaction detail + bukti
Database --> Dashboard: Return detail
Dashboard --> Pengurus: Tampilkan untuk review

Pengurus -> Dashboard: Review transaksi

alt Valid & sesuai
  Pengurus -> Dashboard: Klik "Approve"
  Dashboard -> System: Update status = approved
  System -> Database: Save status change
  System -> Database: Include in financial report
  System -> System: Send approval notification
  Database --> System: Success
  System --> Dashboard: Show success
else Tidak valid
  Pengurus -> Dashboard: Klik "Reject"
  Pengurus -> Dashboard: Input alasan reject
  Dashboard -> System: Update status = rejected
  System -> Database: Save status + reason
  System -> System: Send rejection notification
  Database --> System: Success
  System --> Dashboard: Show success
end

Pengurus -> Dashboard: View financial report
Dashboard -> Database: Calculate: approved income - approved expense = balance
Database --> Dashboard: Return calculations
Dashboard --> Pengurus: Tampilkan summary & charts

@enduml
